# Profile Builder API — request collection
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the JetBrains HTTP client.
# Run `npm run dev` first. Click "Send Request" above each block.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Current profile (empty on a fresh clone)
GET {{base}}/api/profile

### 2. Chat turn — streams SSE; the profile updates mid-stream via data-profile parts
POST {{base}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [{ "type": "text", "text": "I'm vegetarian and I love hiking. Thinking about Lisbon in the spring." }]
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Profile after the turn
GET {{base}}/api/profile

### 4. Second turn that triggers a conflict (send the full history; assistant turn abbreviated)
POST {{base}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [{ "type": "text", "text": "I'm vegetarian and I love hiking. Thinking about Lisbon in the spring." }]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "role": "assistant",
      "parts": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Noted. What kind of pace do you like?" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Relaxed. And I can't wait to hit a famous steakhouse there!" }]
    }
  ]
}

### 5. See the held conflict (copy an id from pendingConflicts for step 6)
GET {{base}}/api/profile

### 6. Resolve it — keepExisting | useProposed
POST {{base}}/api/profile/conflicts/PASTE_CONFLICT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resolution": "keepExisting" }

### 7. Unknown destination — assistant must admit it has no data
POST {{base}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "id": "u1", "role": "user", "parts": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What about Atlantis?" }] }
  ]
}

### 8. Validation error — 400 invalid_request
POST {{base}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Unknown conflict id — 404 not_found
POST {{base}}/api/profile/conflicts/does-not-exist
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resolution": "useProposed" }

### 10. Reset
DELETE {{base}}/api/profile
